{"title":"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/d/70d8a348130d140aad5a9c23958578539f753241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> for which there exist <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/3/5732ee2640c9dc15536ac3513c8bf57c6f02d3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_1,\\ldots,A_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" /> in the plane, no three collinear, and real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/c/f8cd68021db402d69867e12b162f5b9a69612da9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1,\\ldots,r_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"11\" /> such that for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/3/4e3045d2f53c7da48801f7843deed6f04f9f6311.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\le i&lt;j&lt;k\\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"141\" height=\"16\" />, the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/1/fe17cdbb37c534e275c871ba105627dac79283bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle A_iA_jA_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/6/0c608cfe0597d3a478478c6ad0ed22706598b195.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_i+r_j+r_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO\" title=\"1995 IMO\">1995 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185347\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 73/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1317/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1276/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.242      1 -total\n 56.24%    6.885      1 Template:IMO_box\n 42.80%    5.239      1 Template:Solution\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19083:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017185347 and revision id 221684. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}